  - Field: Description
    Fingerprint: 'The heart of a continental ice cap: a white dome to every horizon
      combed into sastrugi by the falling wind, mirror-glazed slopes and fields of
      old blue ice strewn with black star-stones, dark charnockite nunataks with
      wind-scooped moats and petrel ledges black with stone-oil. Ice-road carriers
      cross it from serge post to serge post; the Winter Bull grazes upwind.'
